{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"1812edd3-f8bc-4768-a948-8fb9b39ae280","agentId":"a5dce2e7e4b866ce8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Do not spawn subagents or forks. Do not commit or push. Be token-efficient: keep web research focused (one or two searches per topic), read only what you need. Do not edit cuore/app.py, cuore/web/*, cuore/api/* (other agents own them).\n\nRepo C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers; Python .venv\\Scripts\\python.exe; library mes-log-mcp/mes (patterns: mes/code_feel.py for a keyed knowledge table with confidence+source, mes/knowledge.py for TSB data, tests in mes-log-mcp/tests/check_code_feel.py). Car: 2018 Alfa Romeo Stelvio 2.0T (Giorgio platform; Giulia 2.0T shares the engine/EVAP system), VIN ZASFAKPN5J7B88115.\n\nGOAL: \"Others' experience\" — for each error code / fault family / service job, reputable links to YouTube how-to videos and direct forum threads, because other mechanics' experiences are among the most valuable information in a garage.\n\nBuild:\n1. mes-log-mcp/mes/experience.py: LINKS = list of entries {id, keys: [codes like \"P0455\", families like \"EVAP\", jobs like \"oil_change\",\"spark_plugs\",\"brake_fluid\",\"transfer_case\",\"cabin_air_filter\",\"engine_air_filter\",\"drive_belt\",\"battery_12v\",\"window_riser\",\"network_cascade\",\"esim\",\"purge_valve\",\"canister\"], title, url, source: \"youtube\"|\"stelvioforum\"|\"giuliaforums\"|\"alfabb\"|\"alfaowner\"|\"reddit\"|\"other\", kind: \"how_to_video\"|\"forum_thread\"|\"teardown\"|\"owner_report\", covers: one plain sentence, vehicle_fit: \"stelvio_2.0t\"|\"giulia_2.0t\"|\"giorgio\"|\"generic_obd\", date: \"YYYY-MM\" or None, reputation: \"high\"|\"medium\" (high = manufacturer-adjacent, long-standing forum with many confirmations, or a channel with hands-on footage of this platform), verified_at: \"2026-10-07\", verified_how: \"http_200\"|\"youtube_oembed\"}. Functions: for_code(code), for_family(fam), for_job(job), all(); plus a MCP tool `experience_links(code=\"\", family=\"\", job=\"\")` in mes-log-mcp/server.py.\n2. Research and fill: EVAP family (P0440/P0441/P0455/P0456/P0457, ESIM, purge valve, canister, quick-connect, smoke test) for Stelvio/Giulia 2.0T; network cascade U-codes / B1040 / battery-ground issues on Giorgio; B1176 window riser / window initialisation; C141B/C141C camera/radar; P0300-P0304 misfire and coils/plugs on the 2.0T; oil change (incl. MES reset), spark plugs (NGK 90219), engine and cabin air filter, brake fluid + EPB service mode, transfer case oil, drive belt, 12V battery (AGM/registration), TPMS reset, ZF 8HP fluid. Prefer direct thread URLs over forum home pages, and YouTube videos showing the actual Alfa parts. Aim for 2-4 links per topic, quality over quantity.\n3. VERIFY every URL before saving: forum/other pages must return HTTP 200 (requests/urllib with a browser User-Agent, 15 s timeout); YouTube via https://www.youtube.com/oembed?url=<video url>&format=json returning 200 with a title (store that exact title). Drop anything that fails; never invent a URL; no link shorteners. Record verified_how.\n4. Tests mes-log-mcp/tests/check_experience.py: schema; every entry has a non-empty url and title; keys non-empty and known (codes match [PBCU][0-9A-F]{4}, families/jobs from a fixed list); no duplicates; for_code(\"P0455\") returns >= 2 entries incl. at least one YouTube how-to and one forum thread; an optional network check (skipped if offline) re-verifies 5 random URLs. Run it plus check_code_feel.py and check_server.py.\nReport in under 250 words: counts per topic, how many URLs failed verification and were dropped, test results, and the exact function signatures."},"uuid":"d63e904b-5ff5-4c3d-9bf7-11cf5d04ade8","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:23:54.335Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
