{"parentUuid":"bc0ed3af-693c-4614-a9b4-ad0f4cdc628a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"1812edd3-f8bc-4768-a948-8fb9b39ae280","agentId":"a5dce2e7e4b866ce8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XYf2DDRj14WTMvtWDxgeCF","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Alfa Romeo 2.0T spark plug replacement NGK 90219 youtube\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Litra - wymiana świec zapłonowych\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/alfa-romeo-giulia-2-0-liter-spark-plug-replacement.68523/?tl=pl\"},{\"title\":\"Spark plug plugs plug gap 2.0\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/spark-plug-plugs-plug-gap-2-0.66409/\"},{\"title\":\"Giulia 2.0T Spark Plugs: Video for DIY, and thoughts on when to do it.\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/giulia-2-0t-spark-plugs-video-for-diy-and-thoughts-on-when-to-do-it.51873/\"},{\"title\":\"NGK 90219 - Spark Plug\",\"url\":\"https://newparts.com/ngk-90219-spark-plug\"},{\"title\":\"2017-2024 Alfa Romeo Giulia Spark Plug - NGK 90219 - PartsGeek.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.partsgeek.com/46864bp-alfa-romeo-giulia-spark-plug.html\"},{\"title\":\"2018-2024 Alfa Romeo Stelvio Spark Plug - NGK 90219 - PartsGeek.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.partsgeek.com/dxpl79g-alfa-romeo-stelvio-spark-plug.html\"},{\"title\":\"Spark Plug for Alfa Romeo, Dodge, Jeep (NGK 90219)\",\"url\":\"https://www.go-parts.com/ps-product-new.php?sku=363C263\"},{\"title\":\"90219 NGK ILZKR7G7G Spark plug M12 x 1,25, Spanner Size: 16 mm suitable for ALFA ROMEO GIULIA, STELVIO\",\"url\":\"https://www.autodoc.parts/ngk/13669276\"},{\"title\":\"Spark plugs\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plugs.24684/\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Giulia Spark Plugs - 2.0L - Iridium -Mopar/ NGK - Set of 4, 90219 for Alfa Romeo\",\"url\":\"https://alfaaffair.com/start-shopping/performance-upgrades-alfa-romeo?product_id=300013760\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about NGK 90219 spark plugs that are compatible with Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 (2017-2024) and Alfa Romeo Stelvio 2.0 (2018-2024).\n\nThe NGK 90219 are the standard spark plugs for Alfa Romeo 2.0T engines, and they feature an iridium center electrode for enhanced durability and reliability.\n\nThe search results include discussions from Alfa Romeo forums where users share their experiences with the NGK 90219 spark plugs. There are DIY how-to videos available for changing the spark plugs on the Giulia 2.0T, with discussions about whether the recommended Q2/Q4 spark plug change should be done at 30k or 60k miles.\n\nFor pricing, the NGK 90219 spark plugs can be purchased for around $14.97 each, though prices vary by retailer.\n\nWhile the search results reference YouTube videos about spark plug replacement, the specific YouTube links aren't prominently displayed in these results. You may want to search directly on YouTube for \"Alfa Romeo 2.0T spark plug replacement\" to find step-by-step video tutorials for this procedure.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"183bd52b-a7c5-43cb-84f6-a4bfeae7c990","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:25:08.917Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Alfa Romeo 2.0T spark plug replacement NGK 90219 youtube","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SVfS5JZBQg1MrH6ekWNU2w","content":[{"title":"Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Litra - wymiana świec zapłonowych","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/alfa-romeo-giulia-2-0-liter-spark-plug-replacement.68523/?tl=pl"},{"title":"Spark plug plugs plug gap 2.0","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/spark-plug-plugs-plug-gap-2-0.66409/"},{"title":"Giulia 2.0T Spark Plugs: Video for DIY, and thoughts on when to do it.","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/giulia-2-0t-spark-plugs-video-for-diy-and-thoughts-on-when-to-do-it.51873/"},{"title":"NGK 90219 - Spark Plug","url":"https://newparts.com/ngk-90219-spark-plug"},{"title":"2017-202