{"parentUuid":"3b53eb31-7c72-44ab-a9e6-1a36fc276b85","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c66bd475-cde5-4994-87c9-8a1937921ba8","agentId":"a5dce2e7e4b866ce8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X5LJJgmxmzLfpi1BHFud9d","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"reddit Alfa Romeo Stelvio Giulia P0455 P0456 EVAP\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"P0456 on 2017-2023 Alfa Romeo Giulia: EVAP Small Leak Causes and Fixes\",\"url\":\"https://www.go-parts.com/garage/obd-p0456-alfa-romeo-giulia-2017-2023\"},{\"title\":\"Code P0456 on a 2019 Quadrifoglio\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/code-p0456-on-a-2019-quadrifoglio.19288/\"},{\"title\":\"P0456\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/p0456.51472/\"},{\"title\":\"P0455 evaporative emission system large leak detected for the umpteenth time\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/p0455-evaporative-emission-system-large-leak-detected-for-the-umpteenth-time.58868/\"},{\"title\":\"How many different Vapor Canister P/Ns are there?\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/how-many-different-vapor-canister-p-ns-are-there.22360/\"},{\"title\":\"Squadra Logger Reading Codes (P219C, P0455, P0457) - No real issues but question for the group?\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/squadra-logger-reading-codes-p219c-p0455-p0457-no-real-issues-but-question-for-the-group.22705/\"},{\"title\":\"P0456 small leak in evap system help\",\"url\":\"https://www.4c-forums.com/threads/p0456-small-leak-in-evap-system-help.69234/\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Stelvio\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfa_Romeo_Stelvio\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Giulia (2015)\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfa_Romeo_Giulia_(2015)\"}]\n\nI've found search results related to your query about EVAP issues on Alfa Romeo vehicles. Here's what the search revealed:\n\n## Common EVAP Issues on Alfa Romeo Stelvio and Giulia\n\nP0456 on a 2017-2023 Alfa Romeo Giulia means the engine control module has detected a \"Very Small Leak\" in the evaporative emission (EVAP) system. On the Giulia and Stelvio, the EVAP canister is tucked behind the rear passenger wheel well liner and is a known failure point for persistent P0456 and P0440 codes.\n\n## Troubleshooting Steps\n\nAlways check your gas cap first—make sure it's tight and the seal is intact, as this is the most common and cheapest fix. For more persistent issues, dealers can smoke test the system to identify small leaks in components like the purge valve.\n\n## Reported Solutions\n\nCommunity discussions reveal various fixes that owners have pursued, including:\n- Charcoal canister replacement\n- Passenger-side purge valve replacement\n- Gas cap seal replacement\n\nThe search results show these are commonly discussed issues on Alfa Romeo owner forums, with many users sharing their experiences with both P0455 (large leak) and P0456 (small leak) codes.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b3957993-c4f3-4d47-8e02-80fe1d80470d","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:28:51.870Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"reddit Alfa Romeo Stelvio Giulia P0455 P0456 EVAP","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019tmF4CSqFeQpd2DQdZSFR1","content":[{"title":"P0456 on 2017-2023 Alfa Romeo Giulia: EVAP Small Leak Causes and Fixes","url":"https://www.go-parts.com/garage/obd-p0456-alfa-romeo-giulia-2017-2023"},{"title":"Code P0456 on a 2019 Quadrifoglio","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/code-p0456-on-a-2019-quadrifoglio.19288/"},{"title":"P0456","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/p0456.51472/"},{"title":"P0455 evaporative emission system large leak detected for the umpteenth time","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/p0455-evaporative-emission-system-large-leak-detected-for-the-umpteenth-time.58868/"},{"title":"How many different Vapor Canister P/Ns are there?","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/how-many-different-vapor-canister-p-ns-are-there.22360/"},{"title":"Squadra Logger Reading Codes (P219C, P0455, P0457) - No real issues but question for the group?","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/squadra-logger-reading-codes-p219c-p0455-p0457-no-real-issues-but-question-for-the-group.22705/"},{"title":"P0456 small leak in evap system help","url":"https://www.4c-forums.com/threads/p0456-small-leak-in-evap-system-help.69234/"},{"title":"Alfa Romeo Stelvio","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfa_Romeo_Stelvio"},{"title":"Alfa Romeo Giulia (2015)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfa_Romeo_Giulia_(2015)"}]},"I've found search results related to your query about EVAP issues on Alfa Romeo vehicles. Here's what the search revealed:\n\n## Common EVAP Issues on Alfa Romeo Stelvio and Giulia\n\nP0456 on a 2017-2023 Alfa Romeo Giulia means the engine control module has detected a \"Very Small Leak\" in the evaporative emission (EVAP) system. On the Giulia and Stelvio, the EVAP canister is tucked behind the rear passenger wheel well liner and is a known failure point for persistent P0456 and P0440 codes.\n\n## Troubleshooting Steps\n\nAlways check your gas cap first—make sure it's tight and the seal is intact, as this is the most common and cheapest fix. For more persistent issues, dealers can smoke test the system to identify small leaks in components like the purge valve.\n\n## Reported Solutions\n\nCommunity discussions reveal various fixes that owners have pursued, including:\n- Charcoal canister replacement\n- Passenger-side purge valve replacement\n- Gas cap seal replacement\n\nThe search results show these are commonly discussed issues on Alfa Romeo owner forums, with many users sharing their experiences with both P0455 (large leak) and P0456 (small leak) codes."],"durationSeconds":7.801985900044441,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7cca9fe7-2da5-4950-9400-7f074caca00e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"b