{"parentUuid":"2121c799-e938-4bd0-be57-10f0f83d9332","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5dce2e7e4b866ce8","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfouREJU6dWxGKZtSRHpe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SYC3LaUnT6dwHZoybHVDEa","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Alfa Romeo Giulia Stelvio 12V battery replacement youtube DIY"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2161,"cache_read_input_tokens":119657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2161,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01SYC3LaUnT6dwHZoybHVDEa":{"query":"Alfa Romeo Giulia Stelvio 12V battery replacement youtube DIY"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"7e8315a7-60a7-4185-b1ed-8dfc46c19a76","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CfouRE4LYnFy63C3s3yN6","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"9e06cf4a-a915-4315-8542-71c2fe8a354d","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:30:41.461Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"2121c799-e938-4bd0-be57-10f0f83d9332","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c66bd475-cde5-4994-87c9-8a1937921ba8","agentId":"a5dce2e7e4b866ce8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MGmb4Kb6YJaV78EeoLt2EZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Alfa Romeo Giulia Stelvio spark plug replacement youtube DIY\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"How to change ALFA ROMEO STELVIO Spark Plug - step-by-step manuals and video tutorials\",\"url\":\"https://club.autodoc.co.uk/manuals/engine/spark-plug/alfa-romeo/stelvio\"},{\"title\":\"Giulia 2.0T Spark Plugs: Video for DIY, and thoughts on when to do it.\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/giulia-2-0t-spark-plugs-video-for-diy-and-thoughts-on-when-to-do-it.51873/\"},{\"title\":\"Spark Plug Remove/Replace\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plug-remove-replace.11945/\"},{\"title\":\"Giulia Quadrifoglio Spark Plug Replacement\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/giulia-quadrifoglio-spark-plug-replacement.53492/\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Gulia/Stelvio spark plug install - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8MfCso-Qhn4\"},{\"title\":\"Spark plugs\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plugs.24684/\"},{\"title\":\"Spark plug replacement? Should I or NOT?\",\"url\":\"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plug-replacement-should-i-or-not.24141/\"},{\"title\":\"Top 5 Spark Plug FAQs for the Alfa Romeo Giulia\",\"url\":\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=z2f3kLPGGUU\"},{\"title\":\"How to Change Spark Plugs on a 2018 Alfa Romeo Stelvio - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACzj-N1VvDk\"},{\"title\":\"How to change ALFA ROMEO Spark Plug\",\"url\":\"https://club.autodoc.co.uk/manuals/engine/spark-plug/alfa-romeo\"}]\n\nI found several resources for DIY spark plug replacement on the Alfa Romeo Giulia and Stelvio. Here are the key findings:\n\n## YouTube Videos Available\n\nThere is a YouTube video showing how to change spark plugs in modern Alfa Romeo Giulia/Stelvio models equipped with the 2.0T engine. Additionally, there is a tutorial on how to change spark plugs on a 2018 Alfa Romeo Stelvio.\n\n## DIY Difficulty and Time\n\nThe spark plug replacement doesn't require many tools, expertise or much time—approximately 30 minutes compared to even a DIY oil change on the Giulia.\n\n## Specifications and Parts\n\nFor the Stelvio/Giulia 2.0 inline 4-cylinder engine, the Mopar part number is 68292346AA, supplied by NGK with the NGK part number ILZKR7G. The spark plugs should be torqued to 15 foot-pounds, and the ignition coil screw to 71 inch-pounds.\n\n## Additional Recommendations\n\nIt's recommended to apply Mopar dielectric grease inside the coil pack boots when replacing spark plugs, as moisture between the boot and plug is a leading cause of coil pack failure.\n\nYou can find these DIY videos and guides through YouTube and automotive forums like Giulia Forums and Stelvio Forum.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d0c267a4-ce75-4095-80b3-c7fd5a4f6ced","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:30:47.345Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Alfa Romeo Giulia Stelvio spark plug replacement youtube DIY","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_018ZE2dMpiLz2gEzvPCgSeqn","content":[{"title":"How to change ALFA ROMEO STELVIO Spark Plug - step-by-step manuals and video tutorials","url":"https://club.autodoc.co.uk/manuals/engine/spark-plug/alfa-romeo/stelvio"},{"title":"Giulia 2.0T Spark Plugs: Video for DIY, and thoughts on when to do it.","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/giulia-2-0t-spark-plugs-video-for-diy-and-thoughts-on-when-to-do-it.51873/"},{"title":"Spark Plug Remove/Replace","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plug-remove-replace.11945/"},{"title":"Giulia Quadrifoglio Spark Plug Replacement","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/giulia-quadrifoglio-spark-plug-replacement.53492/"},{"title":"Alfa Romeo Gulia/Stelvio spark plug install - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8MfCso-Qhn4"},{"title":"Spark plugs","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plugs.24684/"},{"title":"Spark plug replacement? Should I or NOT?","url":"https://www.stelvioforum.com/threads/spark-plug-replacement-should-i-or-not.24141/"},{"title":"Top 5 Spark Plug FAQs for the Alfa Romeo Giulia","url":"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=z2f3kLPGGUU"},{"title":"How to Change Spark Plugs on a 2018 Alfa Romeo Stelvio - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACzj-N1VvDk"},{"title":"How to change ALFA ROMEO Spark Plug","url":"https://club.autodoc.co.uk/manuals/engine/spark-plug/alfa-romeo"}]},"I found several resources for DIY spark plug replacement on the Alfa Romeo Giulia and Stelvio. Here are the key findings:\n\n## YouTube Videos Available\n\nThere is a YouTube video showing how to change spark plugs in modern Alfa Romeo Giulia/Stelvio models equipped with the 2.0T engine. Additionally, there is a tutorial on how to change spark plugs on a 2018 Alfa Romeo Stelvio.\n\n## DIY Difficulty and Time\n\nThe spark plug replacement doesn't require many tools, expertise or much time—approximately 30 minutes compared to even a DIY oil change on the Giulia.\n\n## Specifications and Parts\n\nFor the Stelvio/Giulia 2.0 inline 4-cylinder engine, the Mopar part number is 68292346AA, supplied by NGK with the NGK part number ILZKR7G. The spark plugs should be torqued to 15 foot-pounds, and the ignition coil screw to 71 inch-pounds.\n\n## Additional Recommendations\n\nIt's recommended to apply Mopar dielectric grease inside the coil pack boots when replacing spark plugs, as moisture between the boot and plug is a leading cause of coil pack failure.\n\nYou can find these DIY videos and guides through YouTube and automotive forums like Giulia Forums and Stelvio Forum."],"durationSeconds":6.2511638000011445,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7e8315a7-60a7-4185-b1ed-8dfc46c19a76","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2121c799-e938-4bd0-be57-10f0f83d9332","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"9e06cf4a-a915-4315-8542-71c2fe8a354d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c66bd475-cde5-4994-87c9-8a1937921ba8","agentId":"a5dce2e7e4b866ce8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SYC3LaUnT6dwHZoybHVDEa","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Alfa Romeo Giulia Stelvio 12V battery replacement youtube DIY\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Battery replacement.\",\"url\":\"https://www.alfaowner.com/threads/battery-replacement.1190455/\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Stelvio / Giulia Key Fob Battery Replacement DIY - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aujuSKYPe68\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo Stelvio DIY Battery Replacement\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cjPr4TU-3wI\"},{\"title\":\"How To Change Alfa Romeo Remote Fob Smart Key Battery - Giulia Stelvio DIY Replace Tutorial - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pnmDe7muqY\"},{\"title\":\"🍀 Alfa Romeo Giulia Battery Replacement 🍀 - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvVCRASmRc8\"},{\"title\":\"How to change ALFA ROMEO STELVIO Battery - step-by-step manuals and video tutorials\",\"url\":\"https://club.autodoc.co.uk/manuals/electrics/battery/alfa-romeo/stelvio\"},{\"title\":\"How to Start an Alfa Romeo Giulia/Stelvio with Dead Key Fob Battery & Replace It - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=76S2X55Mbgc\"},{\"title\":\"Anyone replace their car battery as a DIY?\",\"url\":\"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/anyone-replace-their-car-battery-as-a-diy.49753/\"},{\"title\":\"Alfa Romeo (2017) - New Battery Install - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eHA44nJ48Bc\"},{\"title\":\"Confirm this item fits\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.com/itm/276674408032\"}]\n\nI found several resources for Alfa Romeo Giulia and Stelvio 12V battery replacement:\n\n**YouTube Videos Available:**\n\n1. \"Alfa Romeo Stelvio DIY Battery Replacement\" - a video that shows how to save money and solve electrical issues by doing the replacement yourself (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cjPr4TU-3wI)\n\n2. \"Alfa Romeo Giulia Battery Replacement\" - a step-by-step guide for addressing start/stop issues or errors by replacing the battery (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvVCRASmRc8)\n\n3. \"Alfa Romeo (2017) - New Battery Install\" - a tutorial showing how to install a new 12V battery with simple tips and tricks (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eHA44nJ48Bc)\n\n**Key Tips from Community Experience:**\n\nSome DIY guides include a workaround to maintain power to the car using a secondary 12V supply during battery replacement, which can help prevent dashboard warning lights. However, many owners have successfully completed the replacement without a secondary battery and simply cleared errors on reconnection.\n\nThere are also dedicated tutorial resources like Autodoc that offer video tutorials and step-by-step manuals for the battery replacement process.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"6245874d-7424-495b-922d-cfb21bfd89b8","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:30:47.750Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Alfa Romeo Giulia Stelvio 12V battery replacement youtube DIY","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01UmNbFESgpCNM56JyXpA5En","content":[{"title":"Battery replacement.","url":"https://www.alfaowner.com/threads/battery-replacement.1190455/"},{"title":"Alfa Romeo Stelvio / Giulia Key Fob Battery Replacement DIY - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aujuSKYPe68"},{"title":"Alfa Romeo Stelvio DIY Battery Replacement","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cjPr4TU-3wI"},{"title":"How To Change Alfa Romeo Remote Fob Smart Key Battery - Giulia Stelvio DIY Replace Tutorial - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pnmDe7muqY"},{"title":"🍀 Alfa Romeo Giulia Battery Replacement 🍀 - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvVCRASmRc8"},{"title":"How to change ALFA ROMEO STELVIO Battery - step-by-step manuals and video tutorials","url":"https://club.autodoc.co.uk/manuals/electrics/battery/alfa-romeo/stelvio"},{"title":"How to Start an Alfa Romeo Giulia/Stelvio with Dead Key Fob Battery & Replace It - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=76S2X55Mbgc"},{"title":"Anyone replace their car battery as a DIY?","url":"https://www.giuliaforums.com/threads/anyone-replace-their-car-battery-as-a-diy.49753/"},{"title":"Alfa Romeo (2017) - New Battery Install - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eHA44nJ48Bc"},{"title":"Confirm this item fits","url":"https://www.ebay.com/itm/276674408032"}]},"I found several resources for Alfa Romeo Giulia and Stelvio 12V battery replacement:\n\n**YouTube Videos Available:**\n\n1. \"Alfa Romeo Stelvio DIY Battery Replacement\" - a video that shows how to save money and solve electrical issues by doing the replacement yourself (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cjPr4TU-3wI)\n\n2. \"Alfa Romeo Giulia Battery Replacement\" - a step-by-step guide for addressing start/stop issues or errors by replacing the battery (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvVCRASmRc8)\n\n3. \"Alfa Romeo (2017) - New Battery Install\" - a tutorial showing how to install a new 12V battery with simple tips and tricks (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eHA44nJ48Bc)\n\n**Key Tips from Community Experience:**\n\nSome DIY guides include a workaround to maintain power to the car using a secondary 12V supply during battery replacement, which can help prevent dashboard warning lights. However, many owners have successfully completed the replacement without a secondary battery and simply cleared errors on reconnection.\n\nThere are also dedicated tutorial resources like Autodoc that offer video tutorials and step-by-step manuals for the battery replacement process."],"durationSeconds":6.275597800016403,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7e8315a7-60a7-4185-b1ed-8dfc46c19a76","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root"